{"classification":"mathematical-index-error","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0021","math_ordinal":241,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The preceding sentence chooses n with positive measure for F_n, and the next displayed integral subtracts 2^{-n} times mu(F_n). Subtracting the characteristic function of all F would not yield that integral and need not preserve the required domination; the indexed set F_n is the proof's intended set.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt1.2011/mt133.tex:330","source_normalized_sha256":"74f565793b7a3ffb2efaad553b5bd3743d167fc6b1988baea0be266718868f45","source_text":"g_1=g-2^{-n}\\chi F","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt133.tex:328","target_normalized_sha256":"5c955b12130e1c36db050a869907879b1b6f1460be9fb2fdcfa0110c3f8e3c79","target_text":"g_1=g-2^{-n}\\chi F_n","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V1-S133"}
{"classification":"mathematical-bound-variable-error","correction_applied":true,"id":"O007-CORR-0022","math_ordinal":359,"provenance":{"basis":"exact current source-correction ledger row","kind":"source-correction-ledger","source_resource_ids":["O007-RESOURCE-SOURCE-CORRECTIONS"]},"rationale":"The infimum must range over the tail functions f_m. Using f_n makes the bound variable m vacuous, contradicts the following inequality against inf_{m>=n} of the upper integrals, and does not construct the monotone tail-infimum sequence needed for liminf.","record_type":"source_correction","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","source_locator":"authority/fremlin/source/mt1.2011/mt133.tex:464","source_normalized_sha256":"817a6839b14afcef1130b271010b7d2ee8fdd909d53cbcd392091287fe1e2d39","source_text":"g_n=\\inf_{m\\ge n}f_n","target_locator":"source/id-ID/mt133.tex:465","target_normalized_sha256":"154bc5c8d8ac1f9d7c6ff7bf17eff6364eeb9177ac3a9f432a9fb3325a706c6f","target_text":"g_n=\\inf_{m\\ge n}f_m","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V1-S133"}
